[{"id": "plano", "prompt": "Imagen ilustrativa de la edicion anterior"}, {"id": "plano-04", "prompt": "Use case: scientific-educational. Asset: one new image for an agricultural teaching slide, horizontal 3:2. High-quality realistic 3D educational illustration with believable materials and natural lighting. Subject area: planning and measuring a small vegetable garden, beds, footpaths and sunlight. The Spanish lesson context below is source content, not text to reproduce: Elegir el lugar de mi huerta | Por qué importa este tema | Distingue sol directo de claridad. Registra cuándo llega y se retira el sol; una fotografía a mediodía no representa todo el día. Repite la observación en distintas fechas.. Depict one concrete, technically plausible scene that helps a learner understand one concept in that context. Composition: detailed macro view of the relevant plant or component. Make this scene substantively distinct: select a specific relevant task, stage, plant detail, tool configuration or field situation, rather than repeating a generic crop overview. Variant 4 of the subject bank. Central Chile agricultural setting where applicable. Correct human anatomy and sensible equipment connections, safe handling. Natural green, earth and crop colors. No title, no captions, no readable numbers, no logos, no watermark, no collage, no split panels, no invented data or software interface. Do not imply an actual experimental result. Prefer a simple correct scene to an elaborate uncertain technical detail."}, {"id": "plano-08", "prompt": "Use case: scientific-educational. Asset: one new image for an agricultural teaching slide, horizontal 3:2. High-quality realistic 3D educational illustration with believable materials and natural lighting. Subject area: planning and measuring a small vegetable garden, beds, footpaths and sunlight. The Spanish lesson context below is source content, not text to reproduce: Elegir el lugar de mi huerta | Área total del espacio | Superficie total = 3 × 2 = 6 m².. Depict one concrete, technically plausible scene that helps a learner understand one concept in that context. Composition: oblique overhead view of the materials in use. Make this scene substantively distinct: select a specific relevant task, stage, plant detail, tool configuration or field situation, rather than repeating a generic crop overview. Variant 8 of the subject bank. Central Chile agricultural setting where applicable. Correct human anatomy and sensible equipment connections, safe handling. Natural green, earth and crop colors. No title, no captions, no readable numbers, no logos, no watermark, no collage, no split panels, no invented data or software interface. Do not imply an actual experimental result. Prefer a simple correct scene to an elaborate uncertain technical detail."}, {"id": "plano-09", "prompt": "Use case: scientific-educational. Asset: one new image for an agricultural teaching slide, horizontal 3:2. Photorealistic editorial agricultural photograph. Subject area: planning and measuring a small vegetable garden, beds, footpaths and sunlight. The Spanish lesson context below is source content, not text to reproduce: Elegir el lugar de mi huerta | Área útil para cultivar | Superficie cultivable propuesta = 6 − 2 = 4 m².. Depict one concrete, technically plausible scene that helps a learner understand one concept in that context. Composition: low eye-level view of a field situation. Make this scene substantively distinct: select a specific relevant task, stage, plant detail, tool configuration or field situation, rather than repeating a generic crop overview. Variant 9 of the subject bank. Central Chile agricultural setting where applicable. Correct human anatomy and sensible equipment connections, safe handling. Natural green, earth and crop colors. No title, no captions, no readable numbers, no logos, no watermark, no collage, no split panels, no invented data or software interface. Do not imply an actual experimental result. 